      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Yes, in the current environment, if [*.r2.dev] is added to the whitelist, most of the demand for data distribution can be secured with R2.\n\nWe also believe that dynamic updates can be done manually or by replacing data from Cloudflare API or Workers.\n\nWe know that granting access to Workers can be difficult. If dynamic URL generation by Udon is allowed, the functionality required by Workers can be completely replaced, so the importance of Workers is very low.\n\nIt is important that [*.r2.dev] is added to the whitelist.If you can access R2 unconditionally, the degree of freedom will increase considerably.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-02-26T15:06:28.832Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "By adding [*.r2.dev] to StringDownloader, ImageDownloader, and VideoURL whitelist, you can freely distribute data without worrying about bandwidth restrictions. Furthermore, by combining Works and R2, it becomes possible to deliver changing images such as event information with the same URL!\n\nAlso, CloudFlare does not identify the individual who accessed it, so there is no problem with security.\n\nIf possible, if [*.workers.dev] is also allowed, it will be more versatile.\n\nConsider adding [*.workers.dev] to the whitelist set for StringDownloader and ImageDownloader if you have security concerns. (These appear to be accessed via CloudFlare!)\n\n--JP\n\nCloudflare R2をホワイトリストに追加します。\n\n[*.r2.dev]をStringDownloaderとImageDownloader、VideoURLのホワイトリストに追加することで帯域制限を気にすることなく自由にデータを配信できます。さらにWorksとR2を組み合わせることで、イベント情報など変化する画像を同一のURLで配信することが可能になります！\n\nまた、CloudFlareはアクセスした個人を識別しないため安全上も問題ありません。\n\nもし可能なら[*.workers.dev]も許可されるとより様々な利用ができるでしょう。\n\nセキュリティ上の不安があればStringDownloaderとImageDownloaderに設定されたホワイトリストに[*.workers.dev]入れることを検討してください。(これらはCloudFlareを経由してアクセスしているようです！)",
